Z||000008||Dave Gunsul||07-12-2001||08:12 PM||||No there's no proof of the performance gains with a dyno. I'm just telling you what MY experience is with one!<P>As for exhaust: the chips abviously designed to change certain parameters in the computer<BR>(i.e. fuel curves) to run with a free flowing exhaust.<BR>Jeez, I don't make the crappin' thing I<BR>was just trying to tell you that it worked for me and that I was happy with it.<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
